<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-085" chapter-id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning" source-id="s-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning-ws2069101">
  <p id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p001:m0000" ref="1tc_q18_x7v">景文</persName>兄子<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p001:m0004" ref="hh2_pun_92k">蘊</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p001:m0006" ref="hh2_pun_92k">彥深</persName>。父<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p001:m0010" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_C">楷</persName>，太中大夫</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p002:m0000" ref="1tc_q18_x7v">景文</persName>甚不悅，語之曰：「<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p002:m0011" ref="hh2_pun_92k">阿益</persName>，汝必破我門戶。」<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p002:m0022" ref="hh2_pun_92k">阿益</persName>者，<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p002:m0026" ref="hh2_pun_92k">蘊</persName>小字也。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p003:m0000" ref="hh2_pun_92k">蘊</persName>、<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p003:m0002" ref="16c_0og_lvl_A">攸之</persName>便連謀為亂，會遭<persName id="c-songshu-085-wangyun-child-name-and-mourning:p003:m0012" ref="z8m_a6o_0pl">母</persName>憂，還都</p>
</text>
